url: 'https://www.geoairitel.budi-carto.my.id'
abstract: >-
  Replication package for RitelAI, an explainable GeoAI framework
  that recommends candidate locations for Alfamart and Indomaret
  minimarkets across the Greater Jakarta metropolitan region. The
  release contains a 100 x 100 m analysis grid of 685,318 cells with
  35 predictors, outlet-level features derived from Google Maps
  consumer reviews, the cached block-disjoint development and
  untouched-holdout partition, Top 1/5/10 percent candidate layers
  with local SHAP drivers, and the notebooks and scripts that
  reproduce every reported result.
keywords:
  - explainable GeoAI
  - retail site selection
  - spatial cross-validation
  - consumer sentiment
  - XGBoost
  - Geographical-XGBoost
  - Jabodetabek
